    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I'd like to be able to define multiple keys per mapping.\r\n\r\nWould a PR for this feature be accepted?\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire(\"mini.files\").setup({\r\n\tmappings = {\r\n\t\tgo_in_plus = { '<CR>', 'L' },\r\n\t},\r\n})\r\n\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'd like to be able to define multiple keys per mapping.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Would a PR for this feature be accepted?</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require(&quot;mini.files&quot;).setup({\n\tmappings = {\n\t\tgo_in_plus = { '&lt;CR&gt;', 'L' },\n\t},\n})\n\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.files<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">mappings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">go_in_plus</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;CR&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>L<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t},\n})\n</pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "I'd like to be able to define multiple keys per mapping.\nWould a PR for this feature be accepted?\nrequire(\"mini.files\").setup({\n\tmappings = {\n\t\tgo_in_plus = { '<CR>', 'L' },\n\t},\n})",
